y; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REDeg}\">\\(\\mathrm{REDeg}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4516136f3cd44eb2\" href=\"?note=4516136f3cd44eb2\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)\">\\(\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bc06a64193b5ff40\" href=\"?note=bc06a64193b5ff40\" title=\"68-df-degree-splitting\">68-df-degree-splitting</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mid\">\\(\\mid\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"341dbc6a97001587\" href=\"?note=341dbc6a97001587\" title=\"68-df-incomparable-degrees\">68-df-incomparable-degrees</a>，严格度序及零度由这些定义的上游给定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)\\land\\mathbf b\\mid\\mathbf c)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)\\land\\mathbf b\\mid\\mathbf c)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留标准 r.e. 度分裂结论，但给定 PDF 没有定位到 Sacks 分裂证明。移除以不充分的“Sacks priority method”泛模式作为证明依赖的旧边。两个分支严格低于原度且 join 等于原度；不可比性不是仅由“两者不同”替代。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-degree-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"bc06a64193b5ff40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-incomparable-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"341dbc6a97001587","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree","status":"resolved","id":"4516136f3cd44eb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree","status":"resolved","id":"4516136f3cd44eb2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，$\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)$ 见 [[68-df-degree-splitting]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]，严格度序及零度由这些定义的上游给定。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-degree-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"bc06a64193b5ff40","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，$\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)$ 见 [[68-df-degree-splitting]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]，严格度序及零度由这些定义的上游给定。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-incomparable-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"341dbc6a97001587","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，$\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)$ 见 [[68-df-degree-splitting]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]，严格度序及零度由这些定义的上游给定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"ma